==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|head=[[tartaric]] [[acid]]}}

# a [[white]] [[crystalline]] acid that occurs naturally in many plants, in [[wine]] and in [[tamarind]]; it is used as the [[salt]]s [[cream of tartar]] and [[Rochelle salt]].
# {{label|en|carbohydrate}} The [[aldaric acid]], ''2,3 dihydroxy-succinic acid''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|erythraric acid}}
* {{l|en|E334}} when used as an [[antioxidant]]

